layout: article
title: Storage
description: Unlock the power of cloud storage with AACSearch Storage. Learn how to store, manage, and retrieve files and media assets securely in your applications.
---

AACSearch Storage allows you to manage files in your project. 
You can use it to store images, videos, rows, and other files for your projects. 
It provides APIs to upload, download, delete, and list files, with many added utilities.

{% info title="Looking for a database?" %}
AACSearch Storage stores files like images, PDFs or videos. If you need to store data like profiles, recipes, or transactions, use [AACSearch Databases](/docs/products/databases).
{% /info %}

